Package: Friedman
Title: Simple Tools for Reporting Friedman Rank Tests
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Sammy", "Zighighi", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a small, reproducible helper for running the
    Friedman rank sum test and returning its main results in a
    convenient data-frame format. The package is intended to help
    students and analysts summarize repeated-measures comparisons.
Depends: R (>= 3.1.2)
Imports: ggplot2, dplyr
License: CC0
LazyData: false